1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:02,730
Lycanthrope?

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:09,780
Lycanthropes are those who 
carry the blood of Vargr,

3
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,180
the wolf god of the ancient Vargr Kingdom.

4
00:00:12,830 --> 00:00:16,370
You are a werewolf chosen by a god.

5
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:24,680
As you know, werewolves have inherited 
that blood for generations,

6
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,880
and the status and traditions 
that come with it.

7
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:30,290
Those who wear that necklace,

8
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:33,490
Silver Fang, have the power
 to lead a pack.

9
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:39,140
They are great warriors. 
True Lycanthropes.

10
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:47,190
It's only old folks like me
 who know that now.

11
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:54,040
But you must feel that you're 
different from your kin somehow.

12
00:00:55,260 --> 00:01:00,530
<i>Everyone else naturally becomes a wolf 
under the light of the full moon,</i>

13
00:01:01,410 --> 00:01:03,250
<i>so why not me?</i>

14
00:01:04,730 --> 00:01:08,040
<i>Am I defective after all?</i>

15
00:01:09,330 --> 00:01:16,660
You're different from your kin 
because you were born to lead us.

16
00:01:20,130 --> 00:01:24,060
Be careful. You're the one they're after.

17
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:29,750
Dardan's capturing every 
werewolf he can

18
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:33,110
in order to acquire the blood 
of Vargr in your veins.

19
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:37,780
Some of our kin have been 
hurt or even killed.

20
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:42,990
Because of me?

21
00:01:45,810 --> 00:01:46,750
Damn it!

22
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:48,960
They'll pay for this!

23
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:54,150
You said the others 
were taken to Automnal.

24
00:01:54,150 --> 00:01:54,920
Yes.

25
00:01:56,690 --> 00:01:59,030
Kamil and the others must be there—

26
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:06,480
I swear I'll save our brothers.

27
00:02:07,430 --> 00:02:11,420
Sir, please tell us everything 
you can that might help us.

28
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:42,990
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

29
00:03:45,010 --> 00:03:47,990
- Mortal Combat in Automnal -

30
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:00,010
You still haven't found one?!

31
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:04,510
I'm sorry. There wasn't one 
among the recently captured—

32
00:04:04,510 --> 00:04:06,180
Keep looking!

33
00:04:09,270 --> 00:04:10,020
Dardan!

34
00:04:11,270 --> 00:04:13,520
Release the princess this instant.

35
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:16,030
It's not too late.

36
00:04:16,030 --> 00:04:20,070
What you're trying to do is unforgivable.

37
00:04:21,990 --> 00:04:23,820
Is this about status again?

38
00:04:23,820 --> 00:04:26,820
No. It's a matter of disposition.

39
00:04:27,540 --> 00:04:31,090
That power wasn't passed down to 
those born into the royal family.

40
00:04:31,090 --> 00:04:34,080
It was passed to those 
with the right disposition.

41
00:04:34,080 --> 00:04:36,710
The royal family has 
merely protected that.

42
00:04:37,650 --> 00:04:39,710
You aren't worthy.

43
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:42,730
Even if you were born a royal,

44
00:04:42,730 --> 00:04:48,600
a selfish man like you who sacrifices 
others could never acquire that power.

45
00:04:50,020 --> 00:04:53,350
You won't be able to talk 
down to me for much longer.

46
00:04:54,690 --> 00:04:57,890
There's nothing you can do now.

47
00:04:57,890 --> 00:05:01,440
I'll prove that I was right,
 both back then and now.

48
00:05:27,250 --> 00:05:29,000
<i>What's wrong with this city?</i>

49
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,700
<i>It's so lifeless.</i>

50
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:33,700
<i>All the residents are vampires.</i>

51
00:05:35,150 --> 00:05:37,350
<i>But no one's attacking us.</i>

52
00:05:39,450 --> 00:05:40,810
<i>Don't make eye contact.</i>

53
00:05:44,470 --> 00:05:48,800
<i>So the whole city is 
under Dardan's control?</i>

54
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,870
<i>We're surrounded by enemies.</i>

55
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:55,870
<i>Right now, finding the sword comes first.</i>

56
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:03,130
Looks like the museum's under city hall.

57
00:06:07,490 --> 00:06:10,390
Welcome to the Automnal Public Museum.

58
00:06:11,150 --> 00:06:15,220
I am Trisha, the curator. This way.

59
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,890
<i>Be careful, guys.</i>

60
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:32,240
<i>She's no ordinary vampire.</i>

61
00:06:34,250 --> 00:06:39,250
In here. This is where the ancient
 furnishings are on display.

62
00:06:39,630 --> 00:06:41,460
Feel free to look around.

63
00:06:57,380 --> 00:06:58,640
<i>I found it!</i>

64
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:06,370
<i>Can we take it with us?</i>

65
00:07:06,370 --> 00:07:07,490
<i>I'll try.</i>

66
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:11,980
So you came for that after all.

67
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:16,060
You won't be taking that sword.

68
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:18,870
All of you will die here.

69
00:07:25,660 --> 00:07:27,650
Heli, take the sword 
while she's distracted!

70
00:07:34,350 --> 00:07:36,510
What is this? My hands 
are moving on their own!

71
00:07:46,770 --> 00:07:47,700
Heli!

72
00:07:49,150 --> 00:07:50,590
Wh-What's happening?

73
00:07:51,230 --> 00:07:51,950
My hands...

74
00:07:53,170 --> 00:07:55,110
My body...

75
00:07:55,930 --> 00:07:57,580
I can't move!

76
00:08:00,860 --> 00:08:06,340
That sword may be fearsome, but what 
matters is which way it's pointing.

77
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:11,990
And I can control which way it points.

78
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:17,850
This time, you'll kill your friends with 
the blade you used to slaughter my kin!

79
00:08:19,420 --> 00:08:22,850
If I don't break free of her control, 
I'll cut down all of my friends.

80
00:08:22,850 --> 00:08:25,730
<i>Damn. I can't move my own body!</i>

81
00:08:26,380 --> 00:08:29,820
<i>Is she controlling all 
seven of us by herself?</i>

82
00:08:30,710 --> 00:08:32,900
<i>Shion, can't you do anything?!</i>

83
00:08:32,900 --> 00:08:35,000
I can hypnotize people, too!

84
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,420
Shion!

85
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:53,130
Shion!

86
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:00,100
Stop!

87
00:09:06,410 --> 00:09:07,440
Noa...

88
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:08,900
You're wasting your time.

89
00:09:14,150 --> 00:09:15,200
Noa!

90
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,450
My body's moving on its own!

91
00:09:20,450 --> 00:09:21,410
Noa!

92
00:09:21,410 --> 00:09:22,470
Jaan!

93
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:36,090
Sol...

94
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:40,720
Solon!

95
00:09:54,820 --> 00:09:58,130
<i>Now everything will be mine.</i>

96
00:10:00,210 --> 00:10:02,240
This is just like back then.

97
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:04,190
<i>Solon...</i>

98
00:10:04,750 --> 00:10:06,750
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

99
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:13,840
Noa!

100
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,120
Damn!

101
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,010
What should we do?

102
00:10:18,870 --> 00:10:21,000
I love the looks on your faces.

103
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:22,930
I wish I could share this with someone.

104
00:10:24,260 --> 00:10:28,100
Don't worry. I won't let 
you die that easily.

105
00:10:28,100 --> 00:10:31,150
It'd be a waste to end the fun so—

106
00:10:39,580 --> 00:10:41,110
Damn it! You'll pay for that!

107
00:10:45,590 --> 00:10:46,450
Jino!

108
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:52,210
How does it feel to kill each other?

109
00:10:58,150 --> 00:10:59,800
You poor thing.

110
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:02,190
That was the perfect chance.

111
00:11:02,870 --> 00:11:04,010
<i>Damn it!</i>

112
00:11:04,010 --> 00:11:06,010
This ends now!

113
00:11:18,750 --> 00:11:19,990
Jakah...

114
00:11:23,690 --> 00:11:26,870
There's only one left.

115
00:11:26,870 --> 00:11:29,000
Off with his head!

116
00:11:31,980 --> 00:11:32,750
Jaan...

117
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:47,510
You dare to defy me? How insolent!

118
00:11:52,690 --> 00:11:54,560
Why, you...

119
00:12:08,050 --> 00:12:11,980
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

120
00:12:12,060 --> 00:12:15,960
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

121
00:12:21,990 --> 00:12:23,230
Stop!

122
00:12:31,480 --> 00:12:33,890
Tch. You just won't give up.

123
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,320
Damn you!

124
00:12:41,710 --> 00:12:43,870
<i>Damn. Too shallow.</i>

125
00:12:44,230 --> 00:12:46,070
<i>I've lost too much blood.</i>

126
00:12:46,310 --> 00:12:47,780
<i>I'm too slow.</i>

127
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:52,500
Jakah!

128
00:12:58,870 --> 00:13:01,390
My wound is closing.

129
00:13:02,180 --> 00:13:03,920
Is this Sooha's power?

130
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:09,180
<i>But the others...</i>

131
00:13:19,740 --> 00:13:21,360
This isn't good.

132
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,880
I have to finish this quickly.

133
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:31,330
That old man said the ship transporting 
our kind was going to Automnal, right?

134
00:13:31,330 --> 00:13:32,280
Yeah.

135
00:13:32,710 --> 00:13:34,490
The harbor's over there.

136
00:13:37,570 --> 00:13:38,290
Wait!

137
00:13:39,160 --> 00:13:40,680
What is it, Tahel?

138
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:42,230
Did you find something?

139
00:13:42,230 --> 00:13:46,680
It's faint, but I smell 
our brothers over there.

140
00:13:57,710 --> 00:13:58,680
<i>I can move.</i>

141
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:03,610
<i>Taking damage has weakened 
her control considerably.</i>

142
00:14:04,150 --> 00:14:07,250
<i>She can't control all seven 
of us at once after all.</i>

143
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:10,180
<i>She can only fully control one person.</i>

144
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:13,460
<i>She can only stop the 
other six from moving.</i>

145
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:18,280
<i>And now, she can't even fully control one.</i>

146
00:14:19,620 --> 00:14:22,490
<i>Which means she's running out of steam.</i>

147
00:14:26,420 --> 00:14:27,650
Don't move!

148
00:14:30,410 --> 00:14:31,220
<i>Now!</i>

149
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:40,020
Trena!

150
00:14:40,350 --> 00:14:41,400
It can't be...

151
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:44,060
There's another one?

152
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:51,270
You'll pay for what you've done to Trisha.

153
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:55,040
I'll make sure of that.

154
00:14:59,630 --> 00:15:03,040
Trisha stops your movements, 
and I cut off your heads.

155
00:15:03,430 --> 00:15:08,650
In other words, you can't beat us!

156
00:15:11,020 --> 00:15:12,090
Jaan!

157
00:15:14,190 --> 00:15:15,310
Jakah!

158
00:15:17,590 --> 00:15:18,770
Shion!

159
00:15:31,990 --> 00:15:32,990
How?

160
00:15:51,130 --> 00:15:52,430
Don't bother!

161
00:16:03,290 --> 00:16:06,820
You're the last one.

162
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:11,820
I'll take your head off 
with a single swing!

163
00:16:13,930 --> 00:16:16,980
Stop!

164
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:19,120
Sooha...

165
00:16:22,750 --> 00:16:23,710
Sooha?!

166
00:16:29,710 --> 00:16:30,820
<i>Trisha!</i>

167
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,520
Trisha...

168
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,790
No...

169
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:55,740
You bit me.

170
00:16:57,040 --> 00:17:01,570
If you die...

171
00:17:08,360 --> 00:17:09,500
Sooha!

172
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:13,000
Where is she? Did I imagine that?

173
00:17:13,750 --> 00:17:15,880
She was here a moment ago.

174
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:19,380
<i>No, I'd recognize her anywhere.</i>

175
00:17:20,950 --> 00:17:22,690
<i>Sooha, are you okay?!</i>

176
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:24,780
<i>To the woods.</i>

177
00:17:25,140 --> 00:17:25,980
<i>The woods?</i>

178
00:17:25,980 --> 00:17:29,810
<i>When the full moon rises, 
the ritual will begin.</i>

179
00:17:30,540 --> 00:17:33,530
<i>Before that happens, 
go to the Hivernal Woods.</i>

180
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:37,820
<i>Before Dardan takes my power. Hurry!</i>

181
00:17:38,490 --> 00:17:39,450
Sooha.

182
00:18:02,680 --> 00:18:07,620
That was undoubtedly the 
princess's misty form ability.

183
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:10,270
She used it then, too.

184
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:12,460
Your Highness. Your Highness!

185
00:18:22,890 --> 00:18:25,590
<i>Has her true power awoken?</i>

186
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:30,250
<i>But she shouldn't have full use of it yet.</i>

187
00:18:32,550 --> 00:18:36,630
Eventually, they'll all 
become mine anyway.

188
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:38,430
Lord Dardan.

189
00:18:39,250 --> 00:18:40,050
What is it?

190
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,600
We've found a Lycanthrope.

191
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:48,960
Sooha came here?

192
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,830
Yeah.

193
00:18:50,210 --> 00:18:53,510
She suddenly appeared and vanished?

194
00:18:53,510 --> 00:18:55,860
I think that was her power.

195
00:18:56,330 --> 00:18:58,190
Sooha told me

196
00:18:58,710 --> 00:19:03,580
she's currently trapped on the 
moon altar in the Hivernal Woods.

197
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:05,430
Hivernal Woods?

198
00:19:05,960 --> 00:19:07,080
Wait.

199
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:10,340
It's here.

200
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:15,110
The ritual will be held 
when the full moon rises.

201
00:19:15,550 --> 00:19:19,940
We have to save Sooha before then, 
or Dardan will take her power.

202
00:19:19,940 --> 00:19:20,850
What?

203
00:19:20,850 --> 00:19:23,010
The full moon? But that's tonight!

204
00:19:24,770 --> 00:19:27,020
Can you guys do it?

205
00:19:29,370 --> 00:19:32,890
Who do you think you're talking to?

206
00:19:32,890 --> 00:19:34,110
Of course we can.

207
00:19:36,410 --> 00:19:38,380
Because of me, you—

208
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:41,420
If we don't hurry, the moon's gonna rise.

209
00:19:42,530 --> 00:19:43,740
Yeah.

210
00:19:50,980 --> 00:19:53,000
Okay. Let's go.

211
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:01,340
There are corpses everywhere.

212
00:20:01,890 --> 00:20:03,260
What happened here?

213
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:06,330
It's probably because those sisters died.

214
00:20:06,830 --> 00:20:10,640
These must be the low-ranking 
vampires they bit.

215
00:20:11,630 --> 00:20:14,980
It all started with Dardan, 
the First Vampire.

216
00:20:15,400 --> 00:20:19,300
If we defeat him, all the vampires 
he created will be destroyed.

217
00:20:22,030 --> 00:20:24,640
Where are our kin?

218
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:30,050
I-I was just asked to...

219
00:20:30,670 --> 00:20:31,750
I can't breathe...

220
00:20:31,750 --> 00:20:35,000
You're holding the werewolves 
here somewhere, aren't you?

221
00:20:37,750 --> 00:20:40,360
Hand over the key.

222
00:20:49,070 --> 00:20:50,560
Kamil! Ruslan!

223
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:52,810
Khan! Guys!

224
00:20:52,810 --> 00:20:54,370
I'm so glad!

225
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:57,690
Mahan, you're okay.

226
00:20:58,230 --> 00:20:59,930
Sorry we took so long.

227
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:02,810
Are you two hurt?

228
00:21:02,810 --> 00:21:04,460
We're fine.

229
00:21:04,990 --> 00:21:09,390
We had chances to escape, but we 
stayed to find out what's going on.

230
00:21:09,390 --> 00:21:11,350
Sorry for making you worry.

231
00:21:11,350 --> 00:21:14,270
It's fine. We're just glad you're okay.

232
00:21:16,790 --> 00:21:18,000
Where are the others?

233
00:21:18,280 --> 00:21:21,830
They were taken somewhere else.

234
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:22,510
What?!

235
00:21:22,750 --> 00:21:25,220
To someplace called the moon altar.

236
00:21:25,460 --> 00:21:27,490
The moon altar?

237
00:21:27,490 --> 00:21:30,490
We heard it's in the woods nearby.

238
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:33,980
Okay. Let's go.

239
00:21:46,350 --> 00:21:47,990
You...

240
00:21:48,360 --> 00:21:54,430
I finally found you, Lycanthrope.

241
00:23:33,490 --> 00:23:39,370
<i>Next time, Episode 11: 
"Hazy Moon: Vargr's Blood."</i>

242
00:23:36,990 --> 00:23:40,250
- Vargr's Blood -

